--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr-7976.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+### 🚀 Enhancements and New Features
+
+- `siblings enable`, and `clone` from a RIA store, ask you to confirm a
+  special remote's configuration, which git-annex 10.20261026 requires
+  before using it; without an interactive session they report how to
+  verify it.  `AnnexRepo.verify_remote()` now asks too, unless given
+  `mode='mark-safe'` or `'mark-unsafe'`.
+  Fixes [#7975](https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/7975)
+  ([PR #7976](https://github.com/datalad/datalad/pull/7976))
+  (by [@yarikoptic](https://github.com/yarikoptic))
